# Deny by default: only what deploy/aks/Dockerfile COPYs can enter the build context, so a local .env, a key file or a
# credential JSON in a working tree can never reach an image layer.
*

!LICENSE
!accounting_firm
!demo_data
!deploy/aks/healthcheck.py

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/test_*.py
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/.netrc
**/.git
**/*.duckdb
